&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;AI/ML :&lt;/strong&gt; Frameworks d'orchestration d'agents (LangGraph, CrewAI, Autogen), LLMs (OpenAI, Claude, Mistral), Vector Databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Outils :&lt;/strong&gt; Git, Cloud (GCP/Azure), outils de Spec-Driven Development (SDD), Docker.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
